{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0dab24c0-e7c2-8deb-83a4-f1ddb37cf134",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T12:11:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I'm hoping you can answer a quick question about a fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can try. What are you thinking of putting up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just a short decorative one in the front yard. White picket style. Nothing fancy. The guy says he can start after the first of the year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how tall are you planning on making it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six feet in the front yard. Just to make sure I have that right, you said short and decorative, but six feet tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, yes. Short is relative, I suppose. Six feet. That's what's on the quote."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I just want to be sure, because a picket fence in a front yard is usually a lot lower than that. Most people go around three or four feet. Is six what you really want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. That's what the paper says. I'll have to ask him about that. But the question stands either way. Do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence does need a permit in the city. And the height matters, especially in a front yard, so that's something we'd look at when you apply. Is this a single family home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Single family. I own it. Been there a long while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "392 Van Zandt Avenue. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 392 Van Zandt. Is the fence going along the sidewalk side, or is it set back from the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Set back a bit. There's a strip of grass between the sidewalk and where the fence would go. Maybe a few feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's helpful. You would submit a permit application with a simple sketch showing where the fence goes on your lot, the height, and the materials. The contractor can often help with that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He did say something about that. I figured I'd check with you first rather than have him tell me what I want to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart. It's better to have the permit in hand before any work begins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Another thing. Does the finished side have to face out? The good side, I mean, with the posts and rails behind it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a common requirement, yes. Usually the finished side faces outward, toward the street or the neighbor, and the framing is on your side. The reviewer will go over it when you apply, but plan on it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's how I'd have wanted it anyway. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:09:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you know if the property has a survey or plot plan? That makes the sketch easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think there's one in a folder somewhere. Hold on, I have to shut this off. [pause] Sorry. I set a timer on my phone and it keeps going off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've silenced it twice now and it keeps coming back. Anyway. A survey. I can look for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you find it, great. If not, we can talk about what else works. You can come by the office or look on the city website for the fence permit application. Our office is open again Monday, since we're closed some days around the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday's fine. Nobody's starting anything before the new year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And one more thing, when you talk to your contractor, ask him about the height. If the six feet is a mistake, it's easier to fix on paper now than after the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I'll call him. I'd rather not have a six foot wall of pickets facing the street. People would think I was hiding something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, let's get the number right first. Do you want me to note your phone number in case someone from the office needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0155. Got it. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that covers it. Thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Burdick. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
